- **Modalities:** Text, image, speech, and video input; text output. Reasoning yes (AA lists as reasoning model). Tool use not explicitly detailed on fetched pages.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** AA preview listing reports ~$2.00 / 1M input and ~$12.00 / 1M output (median across providers). Paid pricing.
- **Architecture:** Proprietary (parameter count and detailed architecture not publicly disclosed).

